  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.02,
      "end": 4.88,
      "text": "如果你现在还觉得FD是根据客户的需求直接去铸场开发落地",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 4.88,
      "end": 9.74,
      "text": "那个跟传统的ARP和CRM那种拥有经典没有什么本质性的区别",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 9.74,
      "end": 11.8,
      "text": "甚至你还没有他们做的好",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 11.8,
      "end": 13.84,
      "text": "所以现阶段FD到底是什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 13.84,
      "end": 15.9,
      "text": "因为我做了很长时间了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 15.9,
      "end": 17.68,
      "text": "我接触了很多团队的人",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 17.68,
      "end": 21.02,
      "text": "而且我们团队的FD发工资有12个",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 21.02,
      "end": 24.86,
      "text": "我认为FD是应该站在企业的经营层面去看这个问题",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 24.86,
      "end": 27.42,
      "text": "那这个东西大家可能不太好理解",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1494838465116695,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.07980591803789139
    },
    {
      "start": 27.54,
      "end": 28.54,
      "text": "那我就举一个例子",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 28.54,
      "end": 30.7,
      "text": "我就是站在省钱的角度上去考虑问题",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 34.5,
      "text": "之前我比如说我交付我这个业务的这个成本要1万块钱",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 34.5,
      "end": 37.22,
      "text": "那我现在给你节约成5000块钱",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 39.02,
      "text": "然后达到同样的效果",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 39.02,
      "end": 41.18,
      "text": "这个就是站在经营层面去考虑这个问题",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 41.18,
      "end": 43.82,
      "text": "那如果站在工具层面去考虑问题是怎样的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 43.82,
      "end": 44.7,
      "text": "跟大家说一下",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 44.7,
      "end": 46.38,
      "text": "这个人还是这个人",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 46.38,
      "end": 48.18,
      "text": "那我提高这个人的效率",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 48.18,
      "end": 50.5,
      "text": "但是增量不发生任何改变",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 50.5,
      "end": 52.18,
      "text": "只提高他的效率",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 52.18,
      "end": 55.1,
      "text": "那这就不是企业经营的低性原理",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 55.1,
      "end": 56.7,
      "text": "而不是说你现在有一个需求",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14082455564486354,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.26960018277168274
    },
    {
      "start": 56.74,
      "end": 58.06,
      "text": "你这个需求点给我了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1562750836781093,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.04496346414089203
    },
    {
      "start": 58.06,
      "end": 59.34,
      "text": "我就直接给你做了",
